                <note rend="inline" type="source">810.79611 Pan American Airways, Inc./449:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Cuba</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Judah</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-05-27T18:00:00-04:00">May 27, 1929—6
                    p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>57. Upon request please render all proper assistance to Cyrus F. Wicker
                    representing Pan American Airways Incorporated.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
